@startuml View_Groups_In_Class
title Activity Diagram - View All Groups in Class

|Instructor|
start
:Select a class;
:Click "View Groups";

|Web Application|
:Send request to retrieve\ngroups in class;

|Backend API|
:Validate classId parameter;
:Call GroupService.\nGetGroupsByClassAsync(classId);
:Query database:\nGet groups where\nclassId = {classId};
:Include related data:\n- GroupMembers\n- Projects\n- Leader;

if (Groups found?) then (yes)
  :Map entities to GroupResponseDto;
  :Return List<GroupResponseDto>;
  :Send 200 OK response;
else (no)
  :Return empty list;
  :Send 200 OK response;
endif

|Web Application|
if (Response successful?) then (yes)
  :Display groups list\nwith members and projects;
else (no)
  :Display error message;
  stop
endif

|Instructor|
:View all groups in class;
stop
@enduml

